    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Back injury permanently disables and cuts short the career of thousands of nurses and other healthcare workers every year. It is completely avoidable - but requires a ban on manually lifting patients. How is this possible? With smart techniques and the appropriate use of moving and handling aids.",
